-- Hand check for 2026: 1 March 2026 is a Sunday, so the second Sunday is 8 March; 1 November 2026 is a Sunday, the first Sunday of November.
#ASSERT `the second Sunday of March of` 2026 EQUALS (YMD 2026 3 8)
#ASSERT `the first Sunday of November of` 2026 EQUALS (YMD 2026 11 1)
